        <title>OpenCode Advanced Tips: Parallel Scheduling and Workflow Mastery</title>
        <link>https://Siborne.top/en/p/opencode-parallel-workflow-tips/</link>
        <pubDate>Thu, 07 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://Siborne.top/en/p/opencode-parallel-workflow-tips/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://img.siborne.top/2026/05/052d81651aef7951346921d53d1ad5c4.png" alt="Featured image of post OpenCode Advanced Tips: Parallel Scheduling and Workflow Mastery" /&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;key-highlights&#34;&gt;Key Highlights
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Session Parallel&lt;/strong&gt;: OpenCode&amp;rsquo;s killer feature — run multiple tasks simultaneously without interference, doubling efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ultra Work Mode&lt;/strong&gt;: Type &lt;code&gt;ULW&lt;/code&gt; and the main agent automatically breaks down tasks and dispatches multiple sub-agents to work in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@-mention Agents&lt;/strong&gt;: Assign the frontend specialist to frontend work and the architect to code reviews — the right person for the right job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Timeline Time Machine&lt;/strong&gt;: Roll back to any historical checkpoint at any time, making bold experimentation cost-free.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ralph Loop&lt;/strong&gt;: Let the AI work in a continuous loop for hours to tackle extremely difficult tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-session-parallel-let-ai-do-multiple-things-at-once&#34;&gt;1. Session Parallel: Let AI Do Multiple Things at Once
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is OpenCode&amp;rsquo;s &lt;strong&gt;biggest differentiating advantage&lt;/strong&gt; over other AI programming tools. Traditional tools are serial — you must finish one task before starting the next. OpenCode can run multiple Sessions simultaneously without interference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;basic-operations&#34;&gt;Basic Operations
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Currently running Task A, want to start Task B at the same time&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/new                          &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Create a new Session&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Enter Task B&amp;#39;s requirements in the new Session&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Both Sessions run in the background simultaneously&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Check the status of all Sessions&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/sessions                     &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Spinning symbol = currently running&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Switch to a specific Session&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/session &amp;lt;id&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Go back to the previous Session&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/session prev
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;real-world-scenario&#34;&gt;Real-World Scenario
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suppose you&amp;rsquo;re building a &amp;ldquo;Draw and Guess&amp;rdquo; mini-game with two independent requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirement A&lt;/strong&gt;: Add a timer — start counting on first stroke, game over if exceeding 20 seconds
&lt;strong&gt;Requirement B&lt;/strong&gt;: Allow the brush color to be adjustable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Traditional approach&lt;/strong&gt;: Finish A first, then start B → Requirement B sits idle for 5–10 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenCode approach&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;1. Enter Requirement A, AI starts working
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;2. Type /new to create a new Session
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;3. Enter Requirement B, AI starts working
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;4. Type /sessions to check progress — both are running ↓
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Session 1  ◐  Adding timer logic...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Session 2  ◐  Adding color picker...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Both requirements are developed entirely in parallel, compressing total time from 15 minutes to 8 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;important-notes&#34;&gt;Important Notes
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sessions are &lt;strong&gt;fully isolated&lt;/strong&gt; from each other; modifying the same file may cause conflicts, so assign them to different modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background Sessions won&amp;rsquo;t automatically notify you when done — you need to manually check with &lt;code&gt;/sessions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can always &lt;code&gt;/new&lt;/code&gt; a third, fourth session&amp;hellip; there&amp;rsquo;s no limit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-ultra-work-summon-an-ai-coding-team-with-one-word&#34;&gt;2. Ultra Work: Summon an AI Coding Team with One Word
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If Session Parallel is &amp;ldquo;manual transmission&amp;rdquo;, Ultra Work is &amp;ldquo;full self-driving&amp;rdquo;. Type a magic word and the AI automatically breaks down tasks, assigns them to the most suitable agents, and executes them in parallel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;how-to-trigger&#34;&gt;How to Trigger
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Include any of the following keywords in your prompt:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;ULW
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;ultrawork
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Ultra Work
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;how-it-works&#34;&gt;How It Works
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Your Request: Build me a pet store website
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        ▼
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  │  Sisyphus (Main Agent)           │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  │  1. Break down tasks → Todo List │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  │  2. Assign sub-tasks             │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  └──────┬──────────┬───────────────┘
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;         │          │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    ┌────▼─────┐ ┌──▼──────┐ ┌──────▼──────────┐
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    │ Prophet   │ │ Frontend │ │ Documentation    │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    │ Architecture│ │ UI Dev   │ │ Writer (README)  │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    └──────────┘ └─────────┘ └─────────────────┘
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;         │          │            │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;         └──────────┴────────────┘
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;                    │
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;                    ▼
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;          Complete Project Delivery
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;when-to-use-it&#34;&gt;When to Use It?
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Scenario&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Suitable&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Creating a complete project from scratch&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;✅ Excellent&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Auto-splits frontend, backend, and docs&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Multi-module parallel development&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;✅ Excellent&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Clear division of work among agents&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Small single-file edits&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;❌ Not recommended&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Using a sledgehammer to crack a nut — slower&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Simple bug fixes&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;❌ Not recommended&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;A normal conversation is faster&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Tip&lt;/strong&gt;: The higher the complexity, the greater Ultra Work&amp;rsquo;s value. For simple tasks, the scheduling overhead actually makes it slower.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;real-results&#34;&gt;Real Results
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pet store website was created using Ultra Work mode:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Todo List automatically generated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 background tasks started simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emoji used as decoration in the absence of any image assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean interface, smooth interactions, and complete animations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;3--mention-agents-let-specialists-do-specialist-work&#34;&gt;3. @-mention Agents: Let Specialists Do Specialist Work
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;After installing Oh My OpenAgent (OMO), you have an AI coding team. Use &lt;code&gt;@&lt;/code&gt; to call on a specific agent by name.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;agent-capability-table&#34;&gt;Agent Capability Table
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Agent&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Specialty&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Best Model&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Example Usage&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sisyphus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Planning &amp;amp; task scheduling&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Claude Opus&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Complex multi-step tasks&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prophet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Architecture design &amp;amp; code review&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;GPT 5.5&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Project structure design&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;UI development &amp;amp; page layout&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Gemini 3 Pro&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Responsive layout optimization&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explorer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Web search &amp;amp; research&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;MiniMax&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Look up latest API docs&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Librarian&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Literature review &amp;amp; doc retrieval&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Navigate open-source codebases&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation Writer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;README &amp;amp; comment generation&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Generate project documentation&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multimodal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Image/PDF understanding&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Write code from design mockups&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;usage-examples&#34;&gt;Usage Examples
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
