&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;switching-the-main-agent&#34;&gt;Switching the Main Agent
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Press &lt;strong&gt;Tab&lt;/strong&gt; to switch the main agent for the current conversation, useful when working with a specific role for extended periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;4-timeline-time-machine-experiment-fearlessly-roll-back-anytime&#34;&gt;4. Timeline Time Machine: Experiment Fearlessly, Roll Back Anytime
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;What&amp;rsquo;s the scariest thing in programming? Changing a ton of code only to realize you went in the wrong direction — and now you can&amp;rsquo;t go back. Timeline is your undo button.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;basic-usage&#34;&gt;Basic Usage
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/timeline
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This lists &lt;strong&gt;every conversation step&lt;/strong&gt; in the current Session. Select any checkpoint:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revert&lt;/strong&gt;: Both code and chat content roll back to that checkpoint — as if nothing happened&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;View&lt;/strong&gt;: See what changes the AI made at that point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;real-world-scenario-1&#34;&gt;Real-World Scenario
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;1. You asked the AI to refactor a module → the result is unsatisfactory
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;2. /timeline → select the checkpoint before the refactor → Revert
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;3. Code returns to pre-refactor state, try a different approach
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;pro-tips&#34;&gt;Pro Tips
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After completing a milestone, mentally note that checkpoint (which conversation number)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boldly try radical approaches — you can always one-click roll back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compare two solutions: Revert to Solution A → review → Revert to Solution B → compare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🕐 This is the programming equivalent of &amp;ldquo;save/load game&amp;rdquo;, allowing you to fearlessly explore any possibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;5-ralph-loop-make-the-ai-push-through-to-the-end&#34;&gt;5. Ralph Loop: Make the AI Push Through to the End
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/ralph-loop
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This mode makes the AI &lt;strong&gt;continuously loop&lt;/strong&gt; until the task is truly complete. Perfect for tough nuts that require repeated iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;use-cases&#34;&gt;Use Cases
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Refactor the entire project using the latest Spring Boot 4 standards until all test cases pass&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Check every file under src/ for coding standard violations and fix each one&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Add comprehensive unit tests to the project until coverage reaches 90%&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;compared-to-ultra-work&#34;&gt;Compared to Ultra Work
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Ultra Work&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Ralph Loop&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Mechanism&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Parallel decomposition, multi-agent&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Serial loop, continuous iteration&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Best for&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Building from scratch, multi-module&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Refactoring, fixing, compliance tasks&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Duration&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Minutes to tens of minutes&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Potentially hours&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Endpoint&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Task decomposition complete&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Termination condition met&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚠️ Ralph Loop may run for a very long time — keep an eye on your API credit consumption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;6-daily-efficiency-tips&#34;&gt;6. Daily Efficiency Tips
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1-use-compact-to-save-context&#34;&gt;1. Use &lt;code&gt;/compact&lt;/code&gt; to Save Context
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;When you&amp;rsquo;ve been chatting with the AI for many rounds and the context window is nearly full:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/compact
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The AI condenses previous conversations into a summary, freeing up space to continue working. No need to start a new conversation and lose context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;2-use-init-to-help-ai-quickly-get-up-to-speed-on-a-new-project&#34;&gt;2. Use &lt;code&gt;/init&lt;/code&gt; to Help AI Quickly Get Up to Speed on a New Project
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;When entering a new project, let the AI read through the code first:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/init
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The AI scans the entire project and generates &lt;code&gt;agents.md&lt;/code&gt; as a system prompt. All subsequent conversations will be based on this understanding, greatly improving efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;3-share-your-coding-process&#34;&gt;3. Share Your Coding Process
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/share      &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Generate a shareable link showing the full conversation and code changes&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/unshare    &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Revoke sharing — the link becomes invalid&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/export     &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# Export the conversation log as a file&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use cases:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show colleagues how you used AI to solve a problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document pitfalls encountered for team reference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source material for blog posts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;4-view-available-models&#34;&gt;4. View Available Models
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/models
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Models with the &lt;code&gt;free&lt;/code&gt; tag are free to use. GLM-4.7 and MiniMax-2.1 have decent coding ability suitable for lightweight tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;5-quick-code-paste-vs-code-extension&#34;&gt;5. Quick Code Paste (VS Code Extension)
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In VS Code, select a code snippet → &lt;code&gt;Ctrl + Alt + K&lt;/code&gt; → directly paste it into the OpenCode chat window.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eliminates the context-switching cost of copy-paste and keeps you in flow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
